- what: mawi.py loader using dpkt — parses MAWI pcap into 5-tuple flow keys for the SketchFlow engine. why: step 17 placed the raw pcap; step 18 bridges raw packets to the streaming sketch world, proving the engine handles real Internet backbone traffic (not just synthetic streams or pre-processed CSVs). concept: packet parsing, 5-tuple flows at scale — every IP packet becomes a flow key that the CMS can count.
